        "original_id": "d70d27a7-130b-5263-ba98-441c3d103c15",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Eric Radomski, Bruce Timm, Isaac C. Singleton Jr.\n- TV series: Ultimate Spider-Man, Avengers Assemble, Hulk and the Agents of S.M.A.S.H., Guardians of the Galaxy\n- Film: Batman: Mask of the Phantasm\n- Concepts: Disney XD premiere, successor series, cinematic continuation, voice roles\n\nFacts:\n- Avengers Assemble was designed to capitalize on the success of the 2012 film The Avengers.\n- Avengers Assemble premiered on Disney XD on May 26, 2013, as the successor to an earlier series.\n- Batman: Mask of the Phantasm was directed by Eric Radomski and Bruce Timm.\n- Batman: Mask of the Phantasm is a cinematic continuation of an earlier Batman animated series.\n- Eric Radomski is associated with Ultimate Spider-Man, Avengers Assemble, Hulk and the Agents of S.M.A.S.H., and Guardians of the Galaxy.\n- Isaac C. Singleton Jr. voiced Thanos in the television series Guardians of the Galaxy and Avengers Assemble.\n- Isaac C. Singleton Jr. also voiced Thanos in the video game Lego Marvel's Avengers.",
